<main id="main">
<section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><h1>Our Menu</h1><p>Everything is cooked to order. Wings and tenders come tossed in any sauce you like.</p></div></section>
<div class="tabs"><div class="wrap"><a href="#wings">Wings &amp; Tenders</a><a href="#burgers">Burgers &amp; Sandwiches</a><a href="#hotdogs">Hot Dogs</a><a href="#pizza">Pizza</a><a href="#sides">Nachos, Fries &amp; Snacks</a><a href="#kids">Kids</a><a href="#drinks">Drinks</a><a href="#party">Party Packs</a></div></div>
<div class="wrap">
<section class="msec" id="wings"><h2>Wings &amp; Tenders</h2><p class="note">Tossed in your choice of BBQ, Jerk, Hot, Mild, Teriyaki, Teriyaki-Hot, Lemon Pepper or Honey Mustard.</p>
<div class="mlist">
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">6 Wings</span><span class="p">$7.50</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">8 Wings</span><span class="p">$10.50</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">10 Wings</span><span class="p">$12.50</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">3 Tenders</span><span class="p">$5.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">5 Tenders</span><span class="p">$7.99</span></div>
</div>
<div class="callout"><b>Make it a combo.</b> Add fries &amp; a drink: small combo +$3.99, large combo +$5.99.</div></section>

<section class="msec" id="burgers"><h2>Burgers &amp; Sandwiches</h2><p class="note">Dressed with lettuce, tomato &amp; onions on a toasted bun.</p>
<div class="mlist">
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Hamburger</span><span class="p">$5.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Double Hamburger</span><span class="p">$8.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Tender Sandwich<span class="d">Tenders, bacon, swiss, lettuce &amp; tomato, hot-honey mustard sauce</span></span><span class="p">$6.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Patty Melt<span class="d">Grilled patty, cheese &amp; onions on Texas toast</span></span><span class="p">$5.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Add Bacon</span><span class="p">$1.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Add Cheese</span><span class="p">$1.00</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Add Jalapeños</span><span class="p">$0.75</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">Add Mushrooms</span><span class="p">$0.75</span></div>
</div>
<div class="callout"><b>Make it a combo.</b> Small combo +$3.99, large combo +$5.99.</div></section>

