<section class="msec" id="party" style="padding-bottom:64px"><h2>Party Packs</h2><p class="note">Feeding a crowd? Wings come in up to 5 flavors per order. Flavors: Hot, Mild, Teriyaki, Teriyaki-Hot, Lemon Pepper, Honey Mustard.</p>
<div class="mlist">
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">30 Wings<span class="d">3 flavors</span></span><span class="p">$39.99</span></div>
<div class="mrow"><span class="n">50 Wings<span class="d">3 flavors</span></span><span class="p">$60.99</span></div>
